min_slic3r_version = 2.9.0
0.1.0 Initial experimental left-extruder Hyper Speed bundle. Start/end G-code copied from ideaMaker 5.4.2.8790. Not production-ready.
0.2.0 Dual-extruder printer (T0+T1 electronic lift). Heat/purge gated by is_extruder_used. Slicer XY offset is 0; firmware keeps the ~25 mm X offset. Not production-ready.
0.2.1 Dual print profile keeps wipe tower off. PrusaSlicer wipe tower requires relative E; ideaMaker start G-code is M82 / absolute E.
0.3.0 Print profile is Prusa XL IS 0.20 SPEED layout and speeds, clipped to Pro2 Hyper FFF L1 (150 mm/s, 5000 mm/s2, 15 mm3/s). Travel stays 150 mm/s as confirmed on this machine.
0.3.1 Dual printer only. Left-only printer and print presets removed. Unused tools still skipped with is_extruder_used.
0.4.0 XL-style 0.4 mm print family (0.10 DETAIL, 0.15/0.20/0.25 SPEED and STRUCTURAL, 0.28 DRAFT) plus Generic PETG/ABS/ASA/FLEX. Speeds and volumetric flow still clipped to Hyper FFF L1. Not production-ready.
0.4.1 Configuration Wizard filament is Generic PLA only. Unused PETG/ABS/ASA/FLEX presets removed.
0.4.2 Dual tool-change G-code no longer indexes temperature[previous_extruder] (previous_extruder is -1 on the first change).
0.5.0 Dual start, park/standby tool-change, and end matched to ideaMaker Multicolor.gcode. Standby 180 C, park X30 Y295, 11 mm toolchange retract. Wipe tower still off (absolute E).
0.5.1 Wipe tower is PrusaSlicer's (relative E / M83). Removed hardcoded tool-change park XY from Multicolor.gcode.
0.5.2 Arrange spacing default 6 mm. Supports use current extruder so enabling supports does not disable the wipe tower.
0.5.3 Wipe tower matches XL IS: 25 deg cone, 3 mm brim, 8 mm bridging, 150% purge spacing. Prime all extruders off (independent dual heads, not MMU).
